            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Use of nonmedicamental methods of treatment assists to improve the control of children's bronchial asthma clinical course. Pulsed low-frequency electromagnetic field regulates the state of central and vegetative nervous system and improves psychological status of child. Inphytotherapy has bronchial spasmolytic and immune correction effects.</AbstractText>
